'''''X-Men Adventures'''''<!--boldface per WP:R#PLA--> was a [[comic book]] [[Spin-off (media)|spin-off]] of the animated series. Beginning in November 1992, it adapted the first three seasons of the show; in April 1996, it became '''''Adventures of the X-Men'''''<!--boldface per WP:R#PLA-->, which contained original stories set within the same continuity.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://comics-db.com/Marvel_Comics/X/X-Men/X-Men_Adventures/Volume_1/index.html|title=The 1990s: Claremont's exit, mega-crossovers|access-date=2007-01-26|archive-date=2007-10-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20071008182641/https://comics-db.com/Marvel_Comics/X/X-Men/X-Men_Adventures/Volume_1/index.html|url-status=usurped}}</ref> The comic book lasted until March 1997, shortly after the show's cancellation by the [[Fox Network]].

'''Bibliography'''
